# Copy to apps/web/.dev.vars (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev` browser
# verification. Use DEV-ONLY throwaway values here -- never real production or
# preview secrets, and never commit the copied file.
#
# Admin sign-in (local only; pick any dev password >= a few words):
ADMIN_PASSWORD=dev-only-admin-password
ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=dev-only-session-secret-0123456789abcdef
#
# Books EOI local backend (optional). Without these, /books and the admin Book
# enquiries view fail closed with their normal error surfaces and the artwork
# admin is unaffected -- that is the expected local behavior to verify.
# To exercise Books end to end, point NEON_DATABASE_URL at a DEV Neon database
# provisioned with database/mj-eoi-schema.sql (see
# `node scripts/check-book-eoi-schema.mjs --probe` for the exact setup SQL),
# then supply two distinct >=32-byte dev keys:
# NEON_DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@ep-dev-pooler.region.aws.neon.tech/neondb
# BOOK_EOI_HMAC_KEY=dev-only-hmac-key-0123456789abcdef
# BOOK_EOI_ENCRYPTION_KEY=dev-only-encryption-key-0123456789abcdef
#
# Turnstile cannot be satisfied locally (siteverify would reject localhost);
# admin UI/server behavior is still fully verifiable without it.
